# Polyarb Phase 1.1 — Translation API
# Copy to .env and fill in your values. See docs/learning/07-观察市场.md for setup.
#
# This project does NOT bind to any single LLM vendor — any OpenAI-compatible
# endpoint works (DeepSeek / Qwen / OpenAI / self-hosted vLLM / ...).
#
# First-run flow:
#   1. cp .env.example .env  &&  edit values
#   2. make translate-pending-sample   (limit 50, dry-run to verify)
#   3. make translate-pending FORCE=1  (bulk-translate everything else)
#
# Required:
TRANSLATION_API_BASE=https://api.deepseek.com/v1
TRANSLATION_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here
TRANSLATION_MODEL=deepseek-chat

# Optional — DeepSeek 免费档建议 3-5；付费档 10。If you hit rate limits, lower this.
TRANSLATION_MAX_CONCURRENCY=10
